<title>UK: Vosper Thornycroft up after broker buy note.</title>
<headline>Vosper Thornycroft up after broker buy note.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Vosper Thornycroft Holdings Plc were up 49p to 939p in thin trading volume of 17,000 shares by 0920 GMT after the company's broker Panmure Gordon issued a buy note on the stock, dealers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Panmure visited the company yesterday and likes the stock,&quot; one dealer said. &quot;They think it could go to 10.00 stg.&quot;</p>
<p>No one at Panmure Gordon was immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
